{'symbol': 'K', 'date': '2022-04-04 11:00:00', 'title': 'MORNINGSTAR FARMS® ADVANCES SUSTAINABILITY COMMITMENT WITH NEW RECYCLING, RENEWABLE ELECTRICITY AND INGREDIENT SOURCING INITIATIVES', 'text': "UPDATED INGREDIENTS, PACKAGING AND PROCESS FURTHER REDUCE ENVIRONMENTAL IMPACT AND DRIVE KELLOGG'S BETTER DAYS COMMITMENT FORWARD BATTLE CREEK, MICH. , APRIL 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MORNINGSTAR FARMS® IS EXPANDING ITS CURRENT SUSTAINABILITY EFFORTS THIS YEAR WITH PLANS TO ROLL OUT NEW RECYCLE-READY PACKAGING FOR SELECT PRODUCTS, BEGIN SOURCING 100 PERCENT RENEWABLE ELECTRICITY AND UTILIZE A NEW PLANT-BASED SOY INGREDIENT FROM BENSON HILL® THAT WILL REDUCE THE BRAND'S IMPACTS ON THE ENVIRONMENT."}